WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.845 --> 00:00:06.325
In this video you'll fill in your community profile and see what other members can see about you.

2
00:00:06.827 --> 00:00:11.047
Select My Profile and Bio, at the bottom of the left column.

3
00:00:11.548 --> 00:00:17.538
Your name, school and email show at the top. Select the circle to add a photo of yourself.

4
00:00:18.041 --> 00:00:22.601
Write a short bio: your role, your school, and what you like to share.

5
00:00:23.101 --> 00:00:33.361
Other members only see your name, email, school and bio if you check Share my profile with community members. You can uncheck it any time to take it back.

6
00:00:33.862 --> 00:00:42.312
The second box controls whether your Brain Game badges show on your profile. You choose which badges to feature on the Brain Badges page.

7
00:00:42.813 --> 00:00:46.823
Select Save Profile. A message confirms it saved.

8
00:00:47.325 --> 00:00:55.285
To see how another member's profile looks, open any post and select the author's name. We'll go back to the community first.

9
00:00:55.788 --> 00:01:04.248
Priya has shared her profile, so you can read her bio and send her a message. A member who hasn't checked the box shows only their name and school.
